    <string name="version_2_breaking_changes">
        &lt;h1>Actualizado a OpenSCQ30 v2&lt;/h1>
        &lt;br>
        &lt;b>Breaking Changes&lt;/b>
        &lt;ul>
            &lt;li>Custom equalizer profiles are now device specific. Legacy equalizer profiles must be migrated on the Migrate Legacy Equalizer Profiles page after connecting to a device.&lt;/li>
            &lt;li>Quick presets are now stored in a different format, and no automatic migration is available, so they must be re-created.&lt;/li>
            &lt;li>Device model auto detection is removed, so you now need to select the device model when adding a device.&lt;/li>
        &lt;/ul>
        &lt;p>See &lt;a href="https://github.com/Oppzippy/OpenSCQ30/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md">CHANGELOG.md&lt;/a> for details.&lt;/p>
    </string>
